Z||000000||btoth||10-05-2001||10:12 AM||||No real complaints with IE 6 so far... but not really worth the upgrade in my opinion.<P>Two weird things though:  1 - my num lock randomly turns off when starting different application or when I click hyperlinks on websites.  2 - Why must I have my Active Desktop enabled to display a simple destop picture all the time, never used to.  Its not hard to get around, just annoying.  Active Desktop is slow and I why should it have to "display web content" when the file is on my HD.  Microsft sucks.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||13
